    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d905">

                <pb facs="0968" n="1802" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1802"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/9746</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Garrett</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-29T17:00:00+01:19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 29, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.20 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2425. My 2401, April 27, 8 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d905-f1"/> The statement
                    which I am sending you in the following telegram was prepared by the British and
                    French Ministers. Allizé
                    read it to Loudon this
                    afternoon and left a copy with him. Loudon was obviously immensely relieved by it. It permits of the
                    acceptance of certain of the German demands, possibly all that are essential at
                    the moment. Townley and
                    I were present, but in absence of instructions I told Loudon I could not formally
                    associate myself with this statement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
